sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant M365 as M365 Copilot agent
    participant Cowork as Copilot Cowork skill
    participant Host as Selected MCP Apps host bridge
    participant UI as Sandboxed sales workspace
    participant Fn as Azure Functions MCP server
    participant Data as Synthetic seed or configured CRM MCP
    participant Blob as Azure Blob Storage

    alt M365 declarative-agent surface
        User->>M365: Review pipeline or prepare quote
        M365->>Host: Invoke approved MCP tool
    else Cowork skill surface
        User->>Cowork: Run sales workflow
        Cowork->>Host: Invoke approved MCP tool
    end
    Host->>Fn: Authenticated MCP request
    Fn->>Data: Read dashboard or opportunity
    Data-->>Fn: Normalized sales payload
    Fn-->>Host: structuredContent + UI resource metadata
    Host->>Fn: resources/read(ui://sales/workspace.html)
    Fn-->>Host: text/html;profile=mcp-app
    Host->>UI: Mount inline widget
    UI-->>User: Render dashboard, charts, and filters

    User->>UI: Filter, open opportunity, edit quote
    UI->>Host: callServerTool(preview_quote)
    Host->>Fn: Draft request
    Fn->>Blob: Conditional identity-scoped draft write
    Blob-->>Fn: Draft ID + revision
    Fn-->>Host: Server-calculated preview result
    Host-->>UI: Deliver tool result
    UI-->>User: Show exact preview and simulation label

    User->>UI: Explicitly approve simulated save
    UI->>Host: callServerTool(save_demo_quote)
    opt Host policy for a side-effecting tool
        Host-->>User: Request invocation confirmation
        User-->>Host: Confirm
    end
    Host->>Fn: Token + revision + idempotency key
    Fn->>Blob: Conditional simulated save
    Blob-->>Fn: SIMULATED quote reference
    Fn-->>Host: Simulation result
    Host-->>UI: Deliver tool result
    UI-->>User: SIMULATED — not saved to CRM
